#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Common Conversion Pitfalls"
msgstr "Armadilhas comuns na conversão"

msgid "Global Mutable State"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Recorders ran sequentially, so global mutable state (static maps, shared "
"lists, singletons populated during startup) was incidentally safe. Services "
"run concurrently — any global state that survives conversion must be made "
"thread-safe. Prefer eliminating it entirely: the dependency graph carries "
"values directly, so each entry becomes a named service and each lookup "
"becomes `require()` or `request()`."
msgstr ""

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "ClassLoader &amp; Thread Context ClassLoader (TCCL)"
msgstr "ClassLoader e Thread Context ClassLoader (TCCL)"

msgid ""
"A wrong TCCL surfaces as `ServiceLoader` \"not a subtype\" errors or dev-"
"mode failures. Threads created during startup inherit the creating thread's "
"TCCL — a long-lived thread that captures the per-app runtime CL leaks the "
"`QuarkusClassLoader` across restarts. Clean up threads or `ThreadLocal`s "
"your service owns in `onStop()`; never rely on a global \"reset all TCCLs\" "
"sweep."
msgstr ""

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Concrete Class Proxying"
msgstr "Proxying de classes concretas"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`staticInitServiceAsRecorderValue(ConcreteClass.class)` fails if the class "
"has a non-trivial constructor. Use `staticInitServiceAsRuntimeValue()` "
"instead — `RuntimeValue` is always proxyable."
msgstr ""
"O método ` `staticInitServiceAsRecorderValue(ConcreteClass.class)` ` falha "
"se a classe possuir um construtor não trivial. Utilize, em vez disso, o "
"método ` `staticInitServiceAsRuntimeValue()` ` — ``RuntimeValue` ` é sempre "
"proxyável."

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Package-Private Visibility"
msgstr "Visibilidade “Package-Private”"

msgid ""
"Lambda bytecode runs at runtime but references runtime classes directly. "
"Package-private classes become inaccessible from the generated consolidated "
"class. Ensure any classes referenced within the lambda are `public`, or move "
"them to a `.impl` subpackage and make them public."
msgstr ""

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Never Reference Deployment Classes inside Service Lambdas"
msgstr ""
"Nunca faça referência a classes de implantação dentro de lambdas de serviço"

msgid ""
"Service lambda bodies execute at **runtime** — deployment classes are absent "
"from the runtime classpath. Anonymous inner classes inside instance-method "
"lambdas silently capture `this` (the processor), causing "
"`TransliterationException`. Moving the instantiation to a `private static` "
"helper in the processor avoids the capture but still references a deployment "
"class, causing `NoClassDefFoundError`. Place all helper methods and "
"factories in **runtime** module classes."
msgstr ""

msgid "Teardown-Ordering Parity"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Start ordering is explicit — but so is **stop ordering**, and that is the "
"easy thing to lose. The recorder model gave cleanup incidental ordering from "
"build-step order; a converted service's `onStop` runs only in reverse "
"dependency order. If a cleanup implicitly depended on running before/after "
"another, declare it with `before()` or `after()`. Lost teardown ordering "
"surfaces as unrelated downstream symptoms — verify shutdown explicitly."
msgstr ""
